//   invariant; rollback on EOS repairs to a valid constrained prefix.
// progress: OpenConstrainedSpan and CloseConstrainedSpan each consume one
//   token-step and append at most one visible delimiter, so after steps :=
//   steps + 1 the bound |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps is preserved.
