//   token-step and append at most one visible delimiter, so after steps :=
//   steps + 1 the bound |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps is preserved.
// - RollbackConstrainedSuffix consumes no generation budget and only shrinks or
//   preserves generated; charging one loop step still preserves the bound.
// - Each constrained token-selection helper above consumes 1 token-step. If EOS
