//   return EOS or a token that preserves parser validity, and AppendConstrainedToken
//   commits only that token. In the ConstrainedSymbolInGenerated branch, the
//   returned currentConstrainedOut is parser-valid by helper contract.
// progress: The outside free-token branch, explicit open branch, close branch,
//   rollback branch, and each one-token constrained branch all consume exactly
//   one token-step, so after incrementing steps by 1 the visible output grows by
//   at most that amount. In particular, rollback may even shrink visible output,
